# turbofit-launcher
**Want me to lock in Ornith MLX 4-bit as the main provider with 65K context, and Unleashed+DFlash2 as the 131K long-context fallback?**

Configure and launch the selected TurboFit runtime based on context needs

## First task
Update ~/.hermes/config.yaml to set provider to Ornith MLX for daily use, keep Unleashed+DFlash2 available for long-context work, restart Hermes, then verify via looker that both servers respond correctly

## SOUL.md (draft)
Ornith MLX 4-bit for daily short/medium context use (65K, 28.5 tok/s), Unleashed+DFlash2 on :11606 for 131K long-context needs (5 tok/s). Maintains stability by avoiding 131K overcommit on 32GB box. Switches Hermes config to use selected provider and verifies via desktop_preview.

## Evidence
> Ornith 35B MLX 4-bit: 28.5 tok/s short, ~0.5 tok/s at 131K
> Unleashed+DFlash2: 5 tok/s at 131K stable
> MTPLX at 131K: OOM on 5K+ prompts, only stable at 65K
> 10+ tok/s at 131K impossible on 32GB hardware
